            "background_color": "#f5e8d8",
            "bottm_right_text": "<p>ByteDance Ltd has experienced the most productive, comfortable, and seamless collaboration using our meeting pods. These pods have enabled their teams to meet effectively with individuals across time zones, countries, and continents. The airy feel is enhanced by window vicinity placement for maximum enjoyment.</p>",
