          "settings": {
            "background_color": "#f5e8d8",
            "bottm_right_text": "<p>Expanding their Hangzhou office, Alibaba benefited greatly from our office phone pods and meeting booths solutions. Perfectly incorporated design and placement provided the perfect environment for departmental meetings and training sessions that required focus. With ten pods installed on the existing floor, Alibaba's teams now enjoy enhanced productivity and privacy. Our collaboration with the building service manager and security ensured a seamless integration, considering every detail to meet their specific needs.</p>",
            "bottom_sub_title": "Hangzhou, China",
            "bottom_title": "Alibaba Hangzhou Office",
            "logo_image": "shopify://shop_images/alibaba_group-logo.png",
            "slide_class": "",
