          "settings": {
            "background_color": "#f5e8d8",
            "bottm_right_text": "<p>LG's commercial sales department faced challenges with a chaotic office environment, characterized by noisy sales executives on the phones. Seeking a solution to enhance focus, they turned to our medium Zoom Room/Focus Pods. After evaluating partitioning costs and considering ceiling height and residual value, the management team chose our pods. This smart investment transformed their workspace, providing a dedicated environment for focused sales calls and effective training sessions. This change significantly improved productivity and created a quieter, more organized office atmosphere. They truly reclaimed focus!</p>",
            "bottom_sub_title": "Seoul, South Korea",
            "bottom_title": "LG Corporation",
            "logo_image": "shopify://shop_images/C__Users_long_Downloads_brand-elements-logo-primary-d.svg-removebg-preview.png",
