            "background_color": "#f5e8d8",
            "bottm_right_text": "<p>Since introducing a Meeting Pod from Soundbox, the Boeing Singapore Office has seen significant improvements in productivity and engagement during meetings, events, and training sessions. The pod provides an ideal collaboration space that seamlessly fits into the office design, where employees can focus without distractions from outside noise, making interactions more productive, engaging, and memorable.</p>",
            "bottom_sub_title": "Singapore",
            "bottom_title": "Boeing Singapore Office",
            "logo_image": "shopify://shop_images/boeing-logo.jpg",
            "slide_class": "",
            "slide_image1": "shopify://shop_images/M_1.jpg",
            "slide_image2": "shopify://shop_images/M_2.jpg",
