            "bottm_right_text": "<p>Huawei found that our Meeting Pods greatly enhanced their team dynamics. These pods are perfect for meetings, presentations, and brainstorming sessions, providing an ideal environment for improved rapport, communication, and collaboration. The casual setting of these beautiful bright Meeting Pods has significantly boosted their team's ability to work together more effectively, and kept the spaceous feel of the office area.</p>",
            "bottom_sub_title": "China",
            "bottom_title": "Huawei Tech all branches",
            "logo_image": "shopify://shop_images/huawei-logo.jpg",
            "slide_class": "",
