          "settings": {
            "background_color": "#f5e8d8",
            "bottm_right_text": "<p>Zipline experienced significant benefits from incorporating two meeting pods and a solo pod into their workspace. These pods have greatly enhanced employees' ability to focus, provided a peaceful, yet modern environment for thoughtful work, and boosted productivity. During client calls, the pods ensure employees can perform their tasks accurately, and in meetings, they facilitate effective collaboration and valuable employee input.</p>",
