        "fde14c79-79dd-487b-9223-27464b25d6b0": {
          "settings": {
            "background_color": "#f5e8d8",
            "bottm_right_text": "<p>Tencent’s new breakout area project has greatly enhanced their meeting spaces. With the addition of three medium-sized pods, featuring two corner sofas and table options booth accessories, staff and HR management department now enjoys open and relaxed meetings. This setup has significantly improved their ability to conduct one-on-one staff and HR management sessions in a comfortable and inviting environment.</p>",
